  "summary": "Add backend-owned recovery actions and event-journal rotation so oversized runtime evidence and old parked pending publish rows do not leave operators with an opaque launch block.",
  "reason": "A launch was blocked by an old pending-publish item and an oversized pipeline_events.jsonl file while the Tauri shell was healthy. Operators need prevention for journal growth and explicit backend recovery controls for the same blocker classes.",
