  ],
  "behavior_before": "Autonomy preflight could block launch with only text next actions, and oversized pipeline event journals required manual filesystem remediation outside the Local API.",
  "behavior_after": "Autonomy blockers expose structured recovery actions, the Local API can archive the allowlisted event journal with confirmation, and the pipeline event writer rotates the event journal before it grows into a launch blocker.",
